 "UX Research · Co-design · Digital Health": "UX Research · Co-Design · Digital Health",
 "eVITA (EU–Japan, Dec 2021 – May 2023) · NeU fNIRS brain-sensor workstream · paid position, University of Siegen": "eVITA (EU-Japan, Dez. 2021 – Mai 2023) · Workstream Gehirnsensor NeU fNIRS · bezahlte Stelle, Universität Siegen",
